<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n49642" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θωΰσσω</span></b> , of a dog, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>bark, bay</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hom.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				25
			</span></i>; of a gnat, <i>buzz</i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ag.</u>
				893
			</span></i>: generally, <i>cry aloud, shout</i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Aj.</u>
				308
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Tr.</u>
				153
			</span></i> (anap.), <i><span class="en">
				<u>Or.</u>
				168
			</span></i> (lyr.): c. acc. cogn., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τόνδ᾽ ἐθώϋξας λόγον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					395
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τάσδ᾽ ἀγγελίας ἐθώϋξεν</span>
				ib.<i><span class="en">
				1041
			</span></i> (anap.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τήνδε θωΰσσει βοήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Aj.</u>
					335
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> c. acc. pers.,
				<i>call on, call</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φθέγμα . . τινὸς θώϋξεν αὐτόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>OC</u>
					1624
				</span></i>
			: c. dat., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θ. κυσί</span>
			<i>shout</i> to dogs, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Hipp.</u>
				219
			</span></i> (anap.), cf.<i><span class="en">
				<u>Ba.</u>
				871
			</span></i> (lyr.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
			<i>lament, bewail</i>, dub. in <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				12(3).9
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Syme</span>).</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
